@TransactionsApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Test 1: Get Transactions for Account 1000
GET {{TransactionsApi_HostAddress}}/Transactions/1000
Accept: application/json

###

### Test 2: Get Transactions for Account 1010
GET {{TransactionsApi_HostAddress}}/Transactions/1010
Accept: application/json

###

### Test 3: Get Transactions for Account 1020
GET {{TransactionsApi_HostAddress}}/Transactions/1020
Accept: application/json

###

### Test 4: Post New Transaction Notification
POST {{TransactionsApi_HostAddress}}/Transactions/1010
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "TRX001",
  "accountId": "1010",
  "description": "Test payment to vendor",
  "type": "outcome",
  "amount": "250.00",
  "recipientName": "Test Vendor",
  "recipientBankCode": "TEST123",
  "paymentType": "banktransfer",
  "timestamp": "2026-01-12T10:45:00Z"
}

###

### Test 5: Post Credit Card Transaction
POST {{TransactionsApi_HostAddress}}/Transactions/1010
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "TRX002",
  "accountId": "1010",
  "description": "Online purchase",
  "type": "outcome",
  "amount": "89.99",
  "recipientName": "Online Store",
  "recipientBankCode": "STORE456",
  "paymentType": "creditcard",
  "timestamp": "2026-01-12T10:50:00Z"
}

###

### Test 6: Invalid Account ID (Error Case)
GET {{TransactionsApi_HostAddress}}/Transactions/9999
Accept: application/json

###

### Test 7: OpenAPI/Scalar Documentation
GET {{TransactionsApi_HostAddress}}/scalar/v1
Accept: text/html

###

### Test 8: OpenAPI Specification
GET {{TransactionsApi_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

###
